(5.5 Failure handling defaults) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Producer validation failure: reject before publish and log EventRejected internally.) Tj
T*
(- Broker publish failure: retry with exponential backoff and jitter.) Tj
T*
(- Consumer transient failure: retry according to consumer policy.) Tj
T*
(- Consumer permanent failure: move to DLQ with error classification.) Tj
T*
(- Privacy/security failure: quarantine, alert Security, and block replay until reviewed.) Tj
T*
(- Schema mismatch: reject and notify schema owner and producer owner.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5.6 Ordering guarantees) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
