(10.3 Queues and consumers) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(- Consumers belong to named consumer groups.) Tj
T*
(- Each bounded context owns its consumer group names.) Tj
T*
(- Retry queues are per topic or per consumer group.) Tj
T*
(- DLQs preserve original event, error metadata, consumer, attempt count, and last exception ) Tj
T*
(class.) Tj
