(11.2 Storage model) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Recommended layers:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Hot stream store: broker retention for recent operational replay.) Tj
T*
(2. Canonical event lake: append-only object storage partitioned by date/topic/tenant/country.) Tj
T*
(3. Event index: PostgreSQL index of event metadata for discovery and audit.) Tj
T*
(4. Schema registry: versioned schema definitions and compatibility metadata.) Tj
