T*
(|---|---:|---|) Tj
T*
(| short | 30-90 days | dashboard views, transient notifications |) Tj
T*
(| standard | 1-3 years | content views, sessions |) Tj
T*
(| long | 7-10 years | learning evidence, analytics decisions |) Tj
T*
(| permanent | indefinite unless law requires deletion/anonymization | credentials, passports, audit facts |) Tj
T*
(| jurisdictional | policy-specific | consent, minors, country-specific education records |) Tj
