T*
() Tj
T*
(- Event lake replicated across regions according to customer/jurisdiction policy.) Tj
T*
(- Recovery point objective target: <= 15 minutes for canonical events.) Tj
T*
(- Recovery time objective target: <= 4 hours for event ingestion core.) Tj
T*
(- Multi-region active-active requires deterministic event IDs and regional conflict policy.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
