(21.7 AI Processing Pipeline) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(flowchart LR) Tj
T*
(    Event[Evidence Event] --> Extract[Evidence Extraction]) Tj
T*
(    Extract --> Embed[Embeddings]) Tj
T*
(    Extract --> OntMap[Ontology Mapping]) Tj
T*
(    OntMap --> Retrieve[Graph/Vector Retrieval]) Tj
T*
(    Retrieve --> Infer[Inference Engine]) Tj
T*
(    Infer --> Confidence[Confidence Scoring]) Tj
T*
(    Confidence --> Explain[Explanation]) Tj
T*
(    Explain --> Policy[Bias/Safety/Policy]) Tj
T*
(    Policy --> Publish[CapabilityObserved]) Tj
T*
() Tj
