T*
() Tj
T*
(23. Final Decision) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(CEA-001 establishes canonical events as the permanent language of Syrka. Every service, ) Tj
T*
(connector, AI model, dashboard, database projection, API, and future LMS integration must ) Tj
T*
(produce or consume canonical events rather than relying on platform-specific schemas.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The architecture guarantees that any LMS can be replaced without changing Syrka's intelligence ) Tj
T*
(layer; every AI capability operates on canonical, provenance-rich evidence; every event is ) Tj
T*
(auditable, explainable, replayable, secure, and versioned; and Syrka's strategic intellectual ) Tj
T*
(property remains independent of Open edX or any other external platform.) Tj
ET
endstream
